        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0371, Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe extra large interior thumbturn of the Weslock's 0371 Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt makes it ADA recommended, while the two hardened steel rollers makes it sturdy by helping to prevent sawing. This Traditionale Collection Deadbolt features a five pin cylinder with a 1\" throw and a heavy duty security strike with 3\" screws. A Single Cylinder Lock, it is key operated from outside, thumb turn operated from the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/grade-2-double-cylinder-deadbolt-weslock-0372\"><b>Traditionale Collection Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy duty security strike with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA recommended</a>, extra large interior thumbturn</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 10 year finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime PVD finish on exterior polished brass.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</P>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 2\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
