                "description": "Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The extra large interior thumbturn of the Weslock made 0371 Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt makes it recommended ADA regulations while the two hardened steel rollers makes it sturdy by helping to prevent sawing. This Traditionale Collection Deadbolt features a five pin cylinder with a 1 inche throw and a heavy duty security strike with 3 inches screws. A Single Cylinder Lock, it is key operated from outside, thumb turn operated from the inside.\r\n",
